## Local dev

```bash
docker compose up -d          # start (uses RDS, local Redis)
docker compose down           # stop
docker compose logs portal    # check logs
```

Build context is always the **repo root** — both Dockerfiles rely on `api/`, `worker/`, `requirements.txt`, and `VERSION`.

---

## K8s — first-time install

```bash
helm dependency update infra/helm/cve-portal

helm install cve infra/helm/cve-portal \
  --namespace cve \
  --create-namespace \
  -f infra/helm/cve-portal/values.secret.yaml
```

Secret values file: `infra/helm/cve-portal/values.secret.yaml` (gitignored — copy from `values.secret.example.yaml`).

